### Tier 3: Production Hardening (30 minutes)
**Complete defense-in-depth strategy**

**3a: Custom URL validator bean**

```java
@Component
public class SecureUrlValidator {

    private static final Pattern SAFE_URL_PATTERN = 
        Pattern.compile("^https://(trusted\\.com|partner\\.com|api\\.trusted\\.com)(/.*)?$");

    public boolean isRedirectAllowed(String url) {
        // SECURE: Whitelist pattern matching (avoids parsing complexity)
        return SAFE_URL_PATTERN.matcher(url).matches();
    }
}
```

**3b: Monitoring for bypass attempts**

```java
@Component
public class URLBypassDetector extends OncePerRequestFilter {

    private static final Counter bypassAttempts =
        Counter.builder("url.bypass_attempts")
            .description("Potential URL validation bypass attempts")
            .register(new SimpleMeterRegistry());

    @Override
    protected void doFilterInternal(HttpServletRequest request,
            HttpServletResponse response, FilterChain filterChain)
            throws ServletException, IOException {

        String url = request.getParameter("url");
        if (url != null) {
            // Check for fragment bypass attempts
            if (url.contains("#")) {
                bypassAttempts.increment();
                System.err.println(
                    "[ALERT] URL fragment detected: " + url);
            }

            // Check for userinfo bypass
            if (url.contains("@")) {
                bypassAttempts.increment();
                System.err.println(
                    "[ALERT] URL userinfo detected: " + url);
            }
        }

        filterChain.doFilter(request, response);
    }
}
```

**3c: SAST detection rules**

```yaml
# .semgrep.yml
rules:
  - id: unsafe-uricomponentsbuilder-validation
    pattern: |
      UriComponents $COMPONENTS = UriComponentsBuilder.fromUriString($URL).build();
      ...
      $HOST = $COMPONENTS.getHost();
      ...
      if ($HOST.equals($ALLOWED)) { }
    message: "UriComponentsBuilder is vulnerable to fragment bypass - add fragment validation"
    languages: [java]
    severity: WARNING

  - id: missing-fragment-validation
    pattern: |
      String $FRAGMENT = $URI.getFragment();
    message: "Verify fragment is null or rejected for redirect/SSRF prevention"
    languages: [java]
    severity: ERROR
```

**3d: Alert rules**

```yaml
groups:
  - name: url_validation_security
    rules:
      - alert: URLBypassAttemptDetected
        expr: rate(url_bypass_attempts[1m]) > 0
        for: 1m
        annotations:
          summary: "URL validation bypass attempt detected"
          severity: "HIGH"
          action: "Investigate and block source IP"
```

