docker run -d --name ssrf-lab -p 8080:8080 spring-url-testbed:latest
# Test SSRF via URL parsing confusion
curl 'http://localhost:8080/api/fetch?url=http://127.0.0.1:8080/admin'
# Expected: 403 Forbidden — internal IP blocked by allowlist
```

## Performance Considerations

URL validation adds minimal overhead to request processing:

- `UriComponentsBuilder.fromUriString()` parsing: <0.2ms per URL — suitable for high-throughput API gateways
- DNS resolution caching for allowlist validation: amortized <0.1ms after initial lookup
- Avoid calling external DNS for every request — cache resolved IPs with 60s TTL to prevent TOCTOU attacks

